hared, refined, and applied to new challenges. The question isn't whether insight is valuable—it's how to effectively capture, organize, and leverage it across your organization.\n                        ",[5352,5770],"\n                          Insight, when properly harnessed, becomes the cornerstone of innovation, efficiency, and sustainable growth. Unlike physical assets that depreciate over time, insight appreciates as it&lsquo;s shared, refined, and applied to new challenges. The question isn't whether insight is valuable—it's how to effectively capture, organize, and leverage it across your organization.\n                        ",[5352,5770],"\n                          Insight, when properly harnessed, becomes the cornerstone of innovation, efficiency, and sustainable growth. Unlike physical assets that depreciate over time, insight appreciates as it&#39;s shared, refined, and applied to new challenges. The question isn't whether insight is valuable—it's how to effectively capture, organize, and leverage it across your organization.\n                        ",[5352,5770],"\n                          Insight, when properly harnessed, becomes the cornerstone of innovation, efficiency, and sustainable growth. Unlike physical assets that depreciate over time, insight appreciates as it&rsquo;s shared, refined, and applied to new challenges. The question isn't whether insight is valuable—it's how to effectively capture, organize, and leverage it across your organization.\n                        ",[5352,5770],"\n                          Insight, when properly harnessed, becomes the cornerstone of innovation, efficiency, and sustainable growth. Unlike physical assets that depreciate over time, insight appreciates as it's shared, refined, and applied to new challenges. The question isn&apos;t whether insight is valuable—it's how to effectively capture, organize, and leverage it across your organization.\n                        ",[5352,5770],"\n                  