es. The question isn't whether insight is valuable—it&lsquo;s how to effectively capture, organize, and leverage it across your organization.\n                        ",[5352,5770],"\n                          Insight, when properly harnessed, becomes the cornerstone of innovation, efficiency, and sustainable growth. Unlike physical assets that depreciate over time, insight appreciates as it's shared, refined, and applied to new challenges. The question isn't whether insight is valuable—it&#39;s how to effectively capture, organize, and leverage it across your organization.\n                        ",[5352,5770],"\n                          Insight, when properly harnessed, becomes the cornerstone of innovation, efficiency, and sustainable growth. Unlike physical assets that depreciate over time, insight appreciates as it's shared, refined, and applied to new challenges. The question isn't whether insight is valuable—it&rsquo;s how to effectively capture, organize, and leverage it across your organization.\n                        ",[7697,7934],"\n                          When these elements align, organizations can transform tacit insight (experience and expertise residing in employees&apos; minds) into explicit insight (documented and accessible resources).\n                        ",[7697,7934],"\n                          When these elements align, organizations can transform tacit insight (experience and expertise residing in employees&lsquo; minds) into explicit insight (documented and accessible resources).\n                        ",[7697,7934],"\n                          When these elements align, organizations can transform tacit insight (experience and expertise residing in employees&#39; minds) into explicit insight (documented and accessible resources).\n                        ",[7697,7934],"\n                          When these elements align, organizations can transform tacit insight (experience and expertise residing in employees&rsquo; minds) into explicit insight (documented and accessible resources).\n                        ","&quot;",[7975,8193],"\n                          &quot;The only sustainable advantage a company has is what it collectively knows, how efficiently it uses what it knows, and how quickly it acquires and uses new insight.\"\n                        ","&ldquo;",[7975,8193],"\n                          &ldquo;The only sustainable advantage a company has is what it collectively knows, how efficiently it uses what it knows, and how quickly it acquires and uses new insight.\"\n                        ","&#34;",[7975,8193],"\n                          &#34;The only sustainable advantage a company has is what it collectively knows, how efficiently it uses what it knows, and how quickly it acquires and uses new insight.\"\n                        ","&rdquo;",[7975,8193],"\n                          &rdquo;The only sustainable advantage a company has is what it collectively knows, how efficiently it uses what it knows, and how quickly it acquires and uses new insight.\"\n                        ",[7975,8193],"\n                          \"The only sustainable advantage a company has is what it collectively knows, how efficiently it uses what it knows, and how quickly it acquires and uses new insight.&quot;\n                        ",[7975,8193],"\n                          \"The only sustainable advantage a company has is what it collectively knows, how efficiently it uses what it knows, and how quickly it acquires and uses new insight.&ldquo;\n                        ",[7975,8193],"\n                          \"The only sustainable advantage a company has is what it collectively knows, how efficiently it uses what it knows, and how quickly it acquires and uses new insight.&#34;\n                        ",[7975,8193],"\n                          \"The only sustainable advantage a company has is what it collectively knows, how efficiently it uses what it knows, and how quickly it acquires and uses new insight.&rdquo;\n                        ",[8582,8636],"Resistance to sharing (the &quot;insight is power\" mindset)",[8582,8636],"Resistance to sharing (the &ldquo;insight is power\" mindset)",[8582,8636],"Resistance to sharing (the &#34;insight is power\" mindset)",[8582,8636],"Resistance to sharing (the &rdquo;insight is power\" mindset)",[8582,8636],"Resistance to sharing (the \"insight is power&quot; mindset)",[8582,8636],"Resistance to sharing (the \"insight is power&ldquo; mindset)",[8582,8636],"Resistance to sharing (the \"insight is power&#34; mindset)",[8582,8636],"Resistance to sharing (the \"insight is power&rdquo; mindset)",[10321,10734],"\n                          In a world where products can be copied, processes can be replicated, and technology quickly becomes commoditized, an organization&apos;s collective insight remains its most defensible asset. By investing in effective insight management strategies and tools, businesses can unlock innovation, improve decision-making, and build resilience against market disruptions.\n                        ",[10321,10734],"\n                          In a world where products can be copied, processes can be replicated, and technology quickly becomes commoditized, an organization&lsquo;s collective insight remains its most defensible asset. By investing in effective insight management strategies and tools, businesses can unlock innovation, improve decision-making, and build resilience against market disruptions.\n                        ",[10321,10734],"\n                          In a world where products can be copied, processes can be replicated, and technology quickly becomes commoditized, an organization&#39;s collective insight remains its most defensible asset. By investing in effective insight management strategies and tools, businesses can unlock innovation, improve decision-making, and build resilience against market disruptions.\n                        ",[10321,10734],"\n                 